                               " o: Continue comments with `o`/`O`
                               " t (default): Auto-wrap text
                               " c (default): Auto-wrap comments
                               " q (default): Allow formettting comments with `gq`
set nojoinspaces               " Don't put two spaces after a period when using `J` or `gq`
